 "personaname": "IM SO YOKED OHHHHHHHHHH", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/132597387/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 1962, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 724, "last_played": 1789365831, "avatar": "b6c68129713b368ae019bbb6e179bf1fc16cfd3e"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1] Mid at best [/h1]\r\n\r\nI'm only rating yes as I'm a fan of the Sniper Elite Franchise.\r\nA lot of everythings the same though there is SOME new stuff granted, I'm a huge fan of using new French guns but honestly this shoulda just been like a 20 or 30 dollar DLC to SE5.\r\n\r\nDisappointing, but if you're still a fan of the Sniper Elite franchise, definitely pick it up, WHEN ITS ON SALE.", "timestamp_created": 1741241601, "timestamp_updated": 1741241601, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "189475622", "author": {"steamid": "76561198275165939", "personaname": "AUSSIEKNUCKLES", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198275165939/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 1008, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 762, "deck_playtime_at_review": 762, "last_played": 1772434488, "avatar": "71837c0dc4dedd8c881666a5dc83bcb5f404ea4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes I really like this game! (OLED SteamDeck)\n\nNow if you have been playing every Sniper Elite game for years then maybe your expectations are much higher, but for me, I haven’t put a lot of hours into a Sniper game since Elite 3. So because of that, I have gone into this game blind.\n\nFirst off the Maps are great! Some mission designs are irritating and I even had to resort to YouTube for help a few times…. But! The Map design makes me keep playing, I love how the game cycles between One night Map then One day Map, so you never get bored of Day or Night. Not many games shine to well in the Scenery department.\n\nVoice acting! From what I have looked up online, I cannot confirm the voice actor… but I’m telling you, its like playing as Jason Statham! And its awesome!\n\nNow I had Multiplayer disabled cause I didnt want to install Denuvo, but as soon as I finally did, I got reduced FPS, much more frame drops and just far less smooth gameplay. Which was incredibly frustrating!\nI tried uninstall it and removed it but I could not successfully do it on Linux.\nI have enjoyed Axis Invasion mode, which allows random players to join your Campaign and try and hunt you down. Definitely makes for very dynamic gameplay.\n\nIt runs off the bat on the Steamdeck without having to adjust the settings at all which is a bonus.\n\nI bought this game for $73 AUD despite mixed reviews and I have not regretted it.\nThe game is solid!\nIf you have never played a Sniper Elite game or like me have taken a break from the last few iterations, then I definitely think you will enjoy this game.", "timestamp_created": 1741218628, "timestamp_updated": 1741218628, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}